        "text": "Presentations with LibreOffice Impress\nMost people would rather eat glass than speak in front of a group. Still, if you have\nto, you may as well have some cool presentation software to back you up. The\nLibreOffice Impress package provides just about all the fancy bells and whistles\nyou may be using in your Microsoft PowerPoint presentations, and your audience\nwon\u2019t even know you didn\u2019t pay anything for it! Give LibreOffice Impress a chance\nto impress you.\nCHAPTER 12 Word Processing and More with LibreOffice 231\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Creating a new presentation\n\u2022 Taking a tour of LibreOffice Impress\n\u2022 Working with Impress files\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
